# Secrets. ERROR_LOG_READ_KEY (telemetry read-back) lives in .env.local — it's
# an Encrypted Vercel var that `vercel env pull` returns EMPTY, so this file is
# the only durable copy outside the dashboard. `vercel env pull` also writes
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN into whatever file you name, so ignore the pattern, not
# one filename.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
